  m_Name: Scenario_Newhaven
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  townName: Civitas
  startYear: 2042
  introPages:
  - title: Civitas 2042
    body: 'Welcome to the year 2042.


      Following a decade of global negotiations
      on responsible AI development, the AI race has slowed, and transparency in
      AI research has become the global standard.


      By 2035, the most advanced
      AI systems had been proven to match or surpass the world''s leading human experts
      in every field.


      AI is now deeply embedded in government decision-making.
      Few question its capabilities. But one question remains:'
  - title: Should AI always make the decisions for us?
    body: 'By law, citizens retain the right to challenge AI-generated policies in
      person, once a year.


      Today, you are among them.


      You and three
      other students will step into the lives of different citizens and decide on
      your shared future.


      The AI Policy Maker will present policies based
      on the population''s needs. You must vote within a limited time:'
  - title: AGREE. DISAGREE. AMEND.
    body: 'The AI will put policies in front of you. For each one you have a short
      time to <b>Agree</b>, <b>Disagree</b> or <b>Amend</b>.


      A policy passes
      only when over 70% approve*. Otherwise, the AI will revise its proposal and
      try again.'
  - title: First, choose an identity.
    body: 'Step into someone else''s life, experience their world, and understand
      their priorities.


      Every choice has consequences. The future you build
      is yours to decide.'
  - title: Before you join
    body: 'Point at buttons and pull the trigger to press them. Use the grip to pick
      things up.


      There is no winning in Civitas. Only choosing what it values.'
